	It is in very good shape, and will send some pictures as soon as the snow
	is gone.

<P><CENTER>
<A HREF=javascript:history.back()
onMouseOver="TurnOn(); return true;"
onMouseOut="TurnOff(); return true;">
<IMG NAME="back" SRC="../../buttons/back.gif" ALIGN=ABSCENTER BORDER=0 HEIGHT=26 WIDTH=66 ALT="Go back to previous page"></A>
</CENTER>

</BODY> 
